---
import DevPage from '../../layouts/DevPage.astro';
import { OrganizationLab } from './_organization-lab/OrganizationLab';

/*
 * The settings lab (Sean, 2026-10-10; docs/research/organization-lab.md): the Settings button in
 * the action bar, what shows and how it looks, the table's sections and its Hidden section, and
 * search with hidden units, with single units chosen in the table. Two looks for Settings' choices
 * side by side: compact pills and a segmented control.
 */
---

<DevPage
  title="settings lab"
  description="The Settings button, the table's sections, and hidden units, with two looks for its choices."
  wide
>
  <Fragment slot="intro">
    Settings lab. Each converter has the real action bar with a Settings button at the start of its
    tools: what shows, in every category, and how results look. Edit at the table's foot chooses
    single units; hidden ones wait in a Hidden section under their section names. Type a unit's name
    in the box to see how search treats hidden ones. The two differ only in how Settings draws its
    choices; the category, the number, and the region are shared.
  </Fragment>
  <OrganizationLab client:load />
</DevPage>
